      "sourceTextSha256": "b173fa90e186f942a6497b8c2ded242f5d3ac2da1dda1ce0ab77b323eabe75d7",
      "text": "Day 7 · Breakfast at the hotel. After breakfast, private transfer to the airport with your driver for your flight to Cartagena de Indias, one of the best-preserved colonial cities in the Americas and a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Upon arrival at Rafael Núñez International Airport, you will be welcomed by your private English-speaking guide, who will accompany you throughout your stay in Cartagena. In the afternoon, discover Cartagena, where colonial architecture, history and Caribbean charm come together. Explore Bocagrande, Castillogrande and Manga before visiting La Popa Monastery and San Felipe de Barajas Castle.",
